1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Threatened by a ruthless demon, humanity was on the brink of destruction.

2
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:15,000
All seemed lost until a lone mage stepped forward and took up the fight.

3
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:28,000
After his triumph, he was hailed as the Wizard King, and his story became legend.

4
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:38,000
With their reincarnation finally complete, Licht and his comrades set out for the royal capital to begin their invasion.

5
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:46,000
Nozel, Noelle, Mimosa, Sora, Kirsch, and N.

6
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:50,000
With the still unconscious captain in tow, hurry to stop the onslaught.

7
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:52,000
Someone's attacking that area.

8
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:55,000
But that's the village!

9
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:57,000
Stop!

10
00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:01,000
Oh no! Stay back!

11
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:10,000
Asta and Yuno took a detour and soon discovered that Ha's village, their childhood home, was being threatened by a violent elf possessing a magic knight's body.

12
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:12,000
Asta! Yuno!

13
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:14,000
You're really brave, Nash.

14
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:18,000
Good job! Stay back! It's our turn now!

15
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:20,000
Crescent Moonsickle!

16
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:22,000
Four blades!

17
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:24,000
His mana says it all.

18
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:28,000
The elf spirit inside him is crying out in pain.

19
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:31,000
Is it possible? Are the elves asking for help?

20
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:32,000
Hey, Yuno!

21
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:34,000
Let's go, Asta!

22
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:38,000
He's turning into something that's not an elf at all!

23
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:40,000
We should set him free!

24
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:51,000
Did he undo the reincarnation magic?

25
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:53,000
Now that I have this sword...

26
00:01:53,000 --> 00:01:54,000
I can save them!

27
00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:55,000
Now that I have this sword...

28
00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:56,000
I can save them!

29
00:01:56,000 --> 00:01:58,000
I cannot save everyone!

30
00:01:58,000 --> 00:02:00,000
Is it possible?

31
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:02,000
When seems to be nice...

32
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:03,000
I can save everything else...

33
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:04,000
Why no?

34
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:05,000
I cannot lose...

35
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:06,000
There are all these vessels that I can't do...

36
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:07,000
I can't do the job...

37
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:11,000
Ouríssuned song...

38
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:13,000
Thanks.

39
00:02:41,000 --> 00:02:43,000
Thanks,мы.

40
00:03:11,000 --> 00:03:14,280
And let's let nobody out of you

41
00:03:14,280 --> 00:03:15,480
No!

42
00:03:16,360 --> 00:03:16,920
No!

43
00:03:18,120 --> 00:03:19,160
Do we

44
00:03:19,160 --> 00:03:21,560
Yeah!

45
00:03:30,920 --> 00:03:32,760
What's up with that giant rock in the sky?

46
00:03:41,000 --> 00:03:44,920
I don't believe this

47
00:03:44,920 --> 00:03:47,120
Where did that thing come from?

48
00:03:55,600 --> 00:03:56,640
Oh boy

49
00:03:56,640 --> 00:03:59,400
I think it's finally time for me to have some fun for real

50
00:04:11,000 --> 00:04:13,080
What the hell?

51
00:04:13,440 --> 00:04:14,600
The city's in danger

52
00:04:14,600 --> 00:04:18,960
That's our cue, Vanessa

53
00:04:18,960 --> 00:04:19,840
Okay

54
00:04:19,840 --> 00:04:24,660
Hey, take your own broom, would you?

55
00:04:24,780 --> 00:04:26,120
There's no time to get flustered

56
00:04:26,120 --> 00:04:27,340
We gotta go

57
00:04:27,340 --> 00:04:29,760
I wasn't flustered, I'm just saying

58
00:04:29,760 --> 00:04:32,600
Whatever, just hang on tight, okay?

59
00:04:33,160 --> 00:04:34,840
Here we go, crazy cyclone

60
00:04:34,840 --> 00:04:35,880
Pedal to the metal

61
00:04:41,000 --> 00:04:44,280
I sense elven magic up ahead

62
00:04:44,280 --> 00:04:46,580
It's coming from the north and the south

63
00:04:46,580 --> 00:04:49,140
Since there are two places in danger

64
00:04:49,140 --> 00:04:50,740
Perhaps we should split up

65
00:04:50,740 --> 00:04:51,540
Ready?

66
00:04:52,300 --> 00:04:53,060
Of course

67
00:04:53,060 --> 00:04:55,140
See you at the capital

68
00:05:11,000 --> 00:05:16,020
This ain't right

69
00:05:16,020 --> 00:05:19,300
I was expecting to run into a bad guy here

70
00:05:19,300 --> 00:05:22,980
Instead we find you

71
00:05:22,980 --> 00:05:24,800
Why?

72
00:05:31,800 --> 00:05:33,060
What gives?

73
00:05:33,500 --> 00:05:34,420
Stop that

74
00:05:34,420 --> 00:05:45,580
What, are you like

75
00:05:45,580 --> 00:05:46,500
Stupid?

76
00:05:47,280 --> 00:05:48,500
Talk to us, Luck

77
00:05:48,500 --> 00:05:49,600
Luck who?

78
00:05:50,460 --> 00:05:51,820
Oh right, I remember

79
00:05:51,820 --> 00:05:55,060
I think there was somebody he wanted to see

80
00:05:55,060 --> 00:05:56,100
Was it you two?

81
00:05:56,700 --> 00:05:58,040
Either way, he can't

82
00:05:58,040 --> 00:06:00,520
Because thanks to the reincarnation spell

83
00:06:00,520 --> 00:06:03,400
This body now belongs to me, Rufal

84
00:06:03,400 --> 00:06:04,580
Who's Rufal?

85
00:06:04,980 --> 00:06:06,480
What are you going on about?

86
00:06:06,640 --> 00:06:08,320
That spell is forbidden magic

87
00:06:08,320 --> 00:06:09,220
Huh?

88
00:06:09,580 --> 00:06:11,080
I'm not sure of the details

89
00:06:11,080 --> 00:06:13,700
But some other entity has taken over Luck's body

90
00:06:13,700 --> 00:06:15,640
Who could have done that though?

91
00:06:16,340 --> 00:06:16,480
What?

92
00:06:17,140 --> 00:06:18,380
The Eye of the Midnight Sun?

93
00:06:18,980 --> 00:06:19,460
Probably

94
00:06:19,460 --> 00:06:22,180
Luck and the rest of the Royal Knights

95
00:06:22,180 --> 00:06:24,180
Did infiltrate their base after all

96
00:06:24,180 --> 00:06:26,000
Wait a minute

97
00:06:26,000 --> 00:06:30,020
So that big glowing ball we saw hovering in the sky was

98
00:06:30,020 --> 00:06:31,380
The hideout

99
00:06:31,380 --> 00:06:32,180
Crap

100
00:06:32,180 --> 00:06:35,920
I guess the plan to eliminate those monsters must have fallen through somehow

101
00:06:35,920 --> 00:06:39,540
Hey, you got it

102
00:06:39,540 --> 00:06:40,660
I'm surprised

103
00:06:40,660 --> 00:06:42,720
It turns out you're not as dumb as you look

104
00:06:42,720 --> 00:06:44,240
And by the way

105
00:06:44,240 --> 00:06:46,760
We killed those Royal Knights every last one

106
00:06:46,760 --> 00:06:49,100
Here's a tip

107
00:06:49,100 --> 00:06:51,400
If you decide to get in my way

108
00:06:51,400 --> 00:06:53,300
The same thing will happen to you too

109
00:06:53,300 --> 00:07:04,120
Weird

110
00:07:04,120 --> 00:07:07,660
For some reason my kick went in a different direction

111
00:07:07,660 --> 00:07:11,040
Oh

112
00:07:11,040 --> 00:07:13,780
This must be a spell to protect your friends

113
00:07:13,780 --> 00:07:15,180
It's so interesting

114
00:07:15,180 --> 00:07:17,800
You're trying my patience here, pal

115
00:07:17,800 --> 00:07:19,960
I'll make you feel the burn

116
00:07:19,960 --> 00:07:21,700
Eat this

117
00:07:21,700 --> 00:07:23,540
Explosive scatter

118
00:07:23,540 --> 00:07:34,140
The red thread of fate

119
00:07:34,140 --> 00:07:37,220
Rouge is always on the side of the Black Bulls

120
00:07:37,220 --> 00:07:38,680
So she'll protect Luck

121
00:07:38,680 --> 00:07:41,220
Even though his body is possessed right now

122
00:07:41,220 --> 00:07:43,580
Does your little pet have an off switch?

123
00:07:43,640 --> 00:07:44,900
Because it ain't helping me

124
00:07:44,900 --> 00:07:45,640
Seriously?

125
00:07:46,640 --> 00:07:48,100
If it weren't for Rouge

126
00:07:48,100 --> 00:07:50,060
Luck's last attack would have killed you

127
00:07:50,060 --> 00:07:50,960
Besides

128
00:07:50,960 --> 00:07:53,380
If what he said before was the truth

129
00:07:53,380 --> 00:07:55,640
Then Luck's lying dormant in that body

130
00:07:55,640 --> 00:07:57,480
Yeah, I know

131
00:07:57,480 --> 00:07:59,860
That's why I'm trying to give the guy a wake-up call

132
00:07:59,860 --> 00:08:02,260
And I've got just the thing

133
00:08:02,260 --> 00:08:04,320
I'll use flame magic

134
00:08:04,320 --> 00:08:06,660
Explosive scatter shot

135
00:08:06,660 --> 00:08:07,080
Go!

136
00:08:08,720 --> 00:08:10,740
It's such a simple spell

137
00:08:10,740 --> 00:08:13,240
It'll never make contact

138
00:08:13,240 --> 00:08:16,680
They're gone

139
00:08:16,680 --> 00:08:18,480
I still sense their mana

140
00:08:18,480 --> 00:08:19,760
I call this one

141
00:08:19,760 --> 00:08:22,120
Explosive annihilation scatter shot

142
00:08:22,120 --> 00:08:29,360
It's fast

143
00:08:29,360 --> 00:08:32,920
There's not a spell in the world that can hit me

144
00:08:32,920 --> 00:08:36,620
Which means two pitiful humans like you don't stand a chance

145
00:08:36,620 --> 00:08:38,460
Shut up!

146
00:08:38,680 --> 00:08:39,520
Come on!

147
00:08:39,680 --> 00:08:41,660
You're too slow to dot my attacks

148
00:08:41,660 --> 00:08:43,100
Just give up!

149
00:08:48,620 --> 00:08:49,640
Thanks, Vanessa!

150
00:08:50,220 --> 00:08:53,620
Honestly, you boys are so quick to lose your tempers during a battle

151
00:08:53,620 --> 00:08:55,620
Why don't you let me intervene?

152
00:08:55,620 --> 00:08:59,800
Then again, if you do manage to defeat Luck

153
00:08:59,800 --> 00:09:00,740
Who knows?

154
00:09:00,900 --> 00:09:02,460
He might wake up out of shock

155
00:09:02,460 --> 00:09:04,100
If you say so

156
00:09:04,100 --> 00:09:09,980
Explosive scatter!

157
00:09:10,420 --> 00:09:13,240
Time to show how much you've improved after training with me

158
00:09:13,240 --> 00:09:14,580
Give it a rest, would you?

159
00:09:14,620 --> 00:09:16,040
What does it look like I'm doing?

160
00:09:18,120 --> 00:09:20,660
I told you it won't hit me

161
00:09:20,660 --> 00:09:30,820
Luck and I may have fought together a million times

162
00:09:30,820 --> 00:09:33,020
But he's never seen what I'm about to do next

163
00:09:33,020 --> 00:09:35,500
Time bomb explosive scatter shot

164
00:09:35,500 --> 00:09:46,840
Whether it makes contact or not

165
00:09:46,840 --> 00:09:48,140
It still explodes

166
00:09:48,140 --> 00:09:49,720
Good luck, thousands of them all!

167
00:09:49,720 --> 00:09:51,720
You must be kidding

168
00:09:51,720 --> 00:09:53,220
That spell is nothing

169
00:09:53,220 --> 00:09:57,540
Too easy

170
00:09:57,540 --> 00:10:00,380
You could at least make it a challenge for me

171
00:10:00,380 --> 00:10:06,620
I thought you said these things would explode even if they missed

172
00:10:06,620 --> 00:10:08,080
You wouldn't lie to me, would you?

173
00:10:08,460 --> 00:10:10,040
Or did you run out of magic?

174
00:10:10,040 --> 00:10:15,640
If he's dodging by sensing the mana

175
00:10:15,640 --> 00:10:18,620
Magna can just throw in some regular scatter shots

176
00:10:18,620 --> 00:10:21,160
From this distance, I can't miss

177
00:10:21,160 --> 00:10:26,760
Too bad

178
00:10:26,760 --> 00:10:29,300
I picked up on your mana

179
00:10:29,300 --> 00:10:31,120
Nice trick

180
00:10:31,120 --> 00:10:33,880
But I already knew you had that up your sleeve

181
00:10:33,880 --> 00:10:36,620
And I know how fast you are

182
00:10:36,620 --> 00:10:45,060
Did he just make sure it would explode at that exact moment?

183
00:10:46,400 --> 00:10:48,400
You're definitely not luck

184
00:10:48,400 --> 00:10:51,900
Because he would have figured out

185
00:10:51,900 --> 00:10:56,820
I'm stupid enough to blow myself up, Duke!

186
00:10:56,820 --> 00:11:08,680
You're a wily fella, I'll give you that much

187
00:11:08,680 --> 00:11:11,200
But only luck himself could have seen that coming

188
00:11:11,200 --> 00:11:14,060
And I know how to take a hit

189
00:11:14,060 --> 00:11:15,700
Which is more than I can say for you

190
00:11:15,700 --> 00:11:17,340
Flame magic!

191
00:11:17,900 --> 00:11:20,820
Go get to an exploding fireball!

192
00:11:20,820 --> 00:11:29,960
One more thing

193
00:11:29,960 --> 00:11:31,760
Flame bondage formation

194
00:11:31,760 --> 00:11:39,540
Listen, man, I happen to know luck pretty damn well

195
00:11:39,540 --> 00:11:43,980
You're nothing but an imposter

196
00:11:43,980 --> 00:11:45,820
And that means

197
00:11:45,820 --> 00:11:48,720
You don't know the first thing about him or about me

198
00:11:48,720 --> 00:11:50,520
So come at me all you want

199
00:11:50,520 --> 00:11:51,660
But you'll never win

200
00:11:51,660 --> 00:11:56,040
Now give our squad mate back to us

201
00:11:56,040 --> 00:11:56,920
Right now!

202
00:12:03,560 --> 00:12:04,200
What?

203
00:12:07,980 --> 00:12:08,580
You

204
00:12:08,580 --> 00:12:29,560
I'm sorry

205
00:12:29,560 --> 00:12:32,840
Who can never win?

206
00:12:34,260 --> 00:12:35,960
Think again, human

207
00:12:35,960 --> 00:12:55,480
Now, would you care to explain how you two weaklings plan to defeat me?

208
00:12:55,980 --> 00:12:57,600
I'd just love to hear

209
00:12:57,600 --> 00:12:59,360
Keep on talking

210
00:12:59,360 --> 00:13:03,480
I'll throw as many of these fireballs as I have to until luck wakes up

211
00:13:03,480 --> 00:13:06,540
He vanished

212
00:13:06,540 --> 00:13:09,900
Forget it

213
00:13:09,900 --> 00:13:12,640
You won't put another scratch on me

214
00:13:12,640 --> 00:13:16,100
He's so fast

215
00:13:16,100 --> 00:13:17,480
I can't see him

216
00:13:17,480 --> 00:13:26,660
You slow humans could never catch me at this scene

217
00:13:26,660 --> 00:13:33,680
I thought the guy was a monster before

218
00:13:33,680 --> 00:13:35,060
But this is something else

219
00:13:35,060 --> 00:13:36,780
Looking for me?

220
00:13:39,780 --> 00:13:41,600
Well, here I am

221
00:13:41,600 --> 00:13:44,280
Looking for me?

222
00:13:44,280 --> 00:13:45,480
Oh, no

223
00:13:45,480 --> 00:13:50,520
The cat

224
00:13:50,520 --> 00:13:55,080
Controlling the future

225
00:13:55,080 --> 00:13:55,900
No

226
00:13:55,900 --> 00:13:58,000
Controlling fate is more like it

227
00:13:58,000 --> 00:13:59,200
Oh well

228
00:13:59,200 --> 00:14:01,860
Even a cat only has so many lives

229
00:14:01,860 --> 00:14:06,660
And I'm sure that spell really drains your magic reserves, right?

230
00:14:07,320 --> 00:14:10,100
The elves are the ones who were originally blessed by mana

231
00:14:10,100 --> 00:14:11,420
So between you and me

232
00:14:11,420 --> 00:14:14,800
Which one of us do you think will last longer?

233
00:14:14,800 --> 00:14:42,580
Don't tell me you're tired already

234
00:14:42,580 --> 00:14:45,080
I haven't even broken a sweat yet

235
00:14:45,080 --> 00:15:09,320
I warned you about getting in my way

236
00:15:09,320 --> 00:15:11,380
Let me go

237
00:15:11,380 --> 00:15:21,580
Now every human in this kingdom will die

238
00:15:21,580 --> 00:15:23,460
That's the fate you deserve

239
00:15:23,460 --> 00:15:25,980
And we elves will be happy to make it a reality

240
00:15:25,980 --> 00:15:27,600
Shut up

241
00:15:27,600 --> 00:15:28,640
You're free

242
00:15:28,640 --> 00:15:34,260
Not one more word

243
00:15:34,260 --> 00:15:37,840
It doesn't matter to me whether you're an elf or not

244
00:15:37,840 --> 00:15:40,460
Because I'm through talking to you

245
00:15:40,460 --> 00:15:43,460
Luck is the one I want to talk to

246
00:15:43,460 --> 00:15:46,520
So you hurry up and get out of that body

247
00:15:46,520 --> 00:15:47,840
Right now

248
00:15:47,840 --> 00:15:49,140
You hear me?

249
00:15:50,060 --> 00:15:51,140
Luck is mischievous

250
00:15:51,140 --> 00:15:54,200
Always being reckless and causing trouble

251
00:15:54,200 --> 00:15:56,700
But he's still like my little brother

252
00:15:56,700 --> 00:15:58,500
Let go of him

253
00:15:58,500 --> 00:16:01,260
All you humans are selfish traitors

254
00:16:01,260 --> 00:16:04,080
Why should I believe that you care about him?

255
00:16:05,520 --> 00:16:06,840
Don't make me laugh

256
00:16:06,840 --> 00:16:09,340
There's nothing that can undo the reincarnation spell

257
00:16:09,340 --> 00:16:13,020
Especially not whatever flimsy bond you claim to have with this luck person

258
00:16:13,020 --> 00:16:16,900
That disgusting human soul has already been destroyed

259
00:16:16,900 --> 00:16:22,660
Is that right?

260
00:16:23,440 --> 00:16:24,960
Well if that's how it is

261
00:16:24,960 --> 00:16:29,920
Then what are you crying for?

262
00:16:30,960 --> 00:16:33,200
You're acting like someone you're not

263
00:16:33,200 --> 00:16:35,920
But I can tell that you're in there luck

264
00:16:35,920 --> 00:16:36,920
Somewhere

265
00:16:36,920 --> 00:16:40,120
And I want you to know that while you were goofing off

266
00:16:40,120 --> 00:16:42,640
I was working hard and training myself to be stronger

267
00:16:42,640 --> 00:16:44,760
If that pisses you off

268
00:16:44,760 --> 00:16:46,120
Then snap out of it

269
00:16:46,120 --> 00:16:48,320
And fight me already you little moron

270
00:16:48,320 --> 00:16:49,980
That's enough

271
00:16:49,980 --> 00:16:53,980
Luck

272
00:16:53,980 --> 00:16:56,520
If you think you can get rid of us that easily

273
00:16:56,520 --> 00:16:58,100
You've got another thing coming

274
00:16:58,100 --> 00:17:00,840
My red thread of fate has you

275
00:17:00,840 --> 00:17:03,180
And I am never letting go of you

276
00:17:03,180 --> 00:17:05,940
Take control of your body and stop this

277
00:17:05,940 --> 00:17:07,440
No! Shut up!

278
00:17:07,600 --> 00:17:08,280
I won't!

279
00:17:08,900 --> 00:17:10,460
It's not gonna work!

280
00:17:10,800 --> 00:17:11,660
Come on!

281
00:17:11,660 --> 00:17:14,360
Shut your mouth!

282
00:17:15,580 --> 00:17:16,880
Please don't

283
00:17:16,880 --> 00:17:20,620
It's over human!

284
00:17:21,480 --> 00:17:21,880
No!

285
00:17:21,880 --> 00:17:31,700
You think I'd let you hurt them?

286
00:17:34,740 --> 00:17:36,620
Not a chance!

287
00:17:37,900 --> 00:17:39,960
Rouge used up all her power

288
00:17:39,960 --> 00:17:43,500
To trigger a destiny that would bring Asta here

289
00:17:43,500 --> 00:17:50,680
And who are you?

290
00:17:51,480 --> 00:17:52,660
I think you know

291
00:17:52,660 --> 00:17:56,060
But I'll say it as much as it takes

292
00:17:56,060 --> 00:17:59,760
We're luck's friends and fellow magic knights!

293
00:18:03,180 --> 00:18:03,780
Asta

294
00:18:03,780 --> 00:18:05,500
Thank goodness

295
00:18:05,500 --> 00:18:07,780
Friends, huh?

296
00:18:08,320 --> 00:18:10,760
This whole routine is starting to get old

297
00:18:10,760 --> 00:18:13,360
Wait a second

298
00:18:13,360 --> 00:18:15,140
You don't have any magic, do you?

299
00:18:15,300 --> 00:18:18,960
I didn't think it was possible for anyone to be that despised by mana

300
00:18:18,960 --> 00:18:22,960
Yeah, well there's one group who accepts me just the way I am

301
00:18:22,960 --> 00:18:25,500
And they're called the Black Bulls

302
00:18:25,500 --> 00:18:27,600
Luck is part of that group

303
00:18:27,600 --> 00:18:28,960
So you can't have him

304
00:18:28,960 --> 00:18:32,840
You can ramble about friendship all day long

305
00:18:32,840 --> 00:18:36,220
But you still won't be able to keep up with me

306
00:18:36,220 --> 00:18:44,760
You're going to die by your comrade's hands

307
00:18:44,760 --> 00:18:53,700
A human shouldn't be able to match my speed

308
00:18:53,700 --> 00:19:10,580
How's that possible?

309
00:19:11,160 --> 00:19:14,280
Your key is so full of rage that I can read it loud and clear

310
00:19:14,280 --> 00:19:17,180
And this blade will follow you anywhere you go

311
00:19:17,180 --> 00:19:19,820
It can't resist powerful magic like yours

312
00:19:19,820 --> 00:19:25,460
Now I'm annoyed

313
00:19:25,460 --> 00:19:34,880
I'm actually impressed

314
00:19:34,880 --> 00:19:40,660
It's no use

315
00:19:40,660 --> 00:19:43,400
You're no match for my anger

316
00:19:43,400 --> 00:19:46,560
Oh crap

317
00:19:46,560 --> 00:19:52,400
He shouldn't be able to detect me

318
00:19:52,400 --> 00:19:54,400
But his combat sense is off the charts

319
00:19:54,400 --> 00:19:56,820
Hey Magna and Vanessa

320
00:19:56,820 --> 00:19:59,100
Could you guys get me some backup over here?

321
00:19:59,260 --> 00:20:00,020
You bet

322
00:20:00,020 --> 00:20:08,620
What makes you think your attacks will affect me now?

323
00:20:09,340 --> 00:20:10,620
Not only that

324
00:20:10,620 --> 00:20:17,060
This time I've got a handle on how fast you are

325
00:20:17,060 --> 00:20:19,420
You have to know

326
00:20:19,420 --> 00:20:22,460
I can't hold out for long

327
00:20:22,460 --> 00:20:23,900
Better make this count

328
00:20:23,900 --> 00:20:26,560
I've already beat you

329
00:20:26,560 --> 00:20:28,280
You can stop now

330
00:20:28,280 --> 00:20:36,280
He's got no magic so their plan is to hide him from me

331
00:20:36,280 --> 00:20:37,660
Fine then

332
00:20:37,660 --> 00:20:43,440
I'll spread out my mana in all directions until I detect the moment his weapon interrupts it

333
00:20:43,440 --> 00:20:44,440
Found him

334
00:20:44,440 --> 00:20:47,380
Found him

335
00:20:47,380 --> 00:20:49,720
And he's headed straight for me

336
00:20:49,720 --> 00:20:51,440
He can't escape now

337
00:20:51,440 --> 00:20:55,860
My rage overpowers everything

338
00:20:55,860 --> 00:20:59,020
There you are

339
00:20:59,020 --> 00:21:01,140
Do it

340
00:21:01,140 --> 00:21:03,180
Here goes

341
00:21:03,180 --> 00:21:11,020
They messed up my timing

342
00:21:11,020 --> 00:21:12,020
Come on

343
00:21:12,020 --> 00:21:12,460
Come on

344
00:21:12,460 --> 00:21:13,180
Now

345
00:21:13,180 --> 00:21:15,360
He's wide open

346
00:21:15,360 --> 00:21:18,620
You're strong but our bond is stronger

347
00:21:18,620 --> 00:21:21,060
You lose

348
00:21:21,060 --> 00:21:26,180
Nice going Asta

349
00:21:26,180 --> 00:21:27,180
Keep going Asta

350
00:21:27,180 --> 00:21:32,620
Let's get you out of there

351
00:21:32,620 --> 00:21:39,360
He's got so much power left

352
00:21:39,360 --> 00:21:41,460
You humans are doomed

353
00:21:41,460 --> 00:21:43,000
Just wait and see

354
00:21:43,000 --> 00:21:47,960
You really don't know when to throw in the towel do you punk?

355
00:21:47,960 --> 00:21:50,400
We're not going to give up on our friend

356
00:21:50,400 --> 00:21:51,760
We told you

357
00:21:51,760 --> 00:21:57,340
Stop it

358
00:21:57,340 --> 00:22:02,800
Get your hands off me

359
00:22:02,800 --> 00:22:04,700
Make too much distance

360
00:22:04,700 --> 00:22:05,980
Home

361
00:22:05,980 --> 00:22:09,400
A 追い続けてた夢が

362
00:22:09,400 --> 00:22:13,520
独り歩きになってた

363
00:22:13,520 --> 00:22:17,960
次の道への地図は

364
00:22:17,960 --> 00:22:22,240
どこかに忘れてきた

365
00:22:22,240 --> 00:22:26,840
行くあてすら決めず彷徨った

366
00:22:26,840 --> 00:22:30,920
夜道が少しぼやけた

367
00:22:30,920 --> 00:22:48,160
人生は全長だ そう感じることもある 自分らしくとは何も反対とはない

368
00:22:48,160 --> 00:22:56,580
愛なんて知らない 笑うのも痛い でも本当は強くないよ

369
00:22:56,580 --> 00:23:07,240
歩くべき道をずっと手探りだけで探してる

370
00:23:26,580 --> 00:23:41,180
薔薇を削って тебя無し

371
00:23:41,180 --> 00:23:44,920
水曜りのために自分であって有用

372
00:23:44,920 --> 00:23:46,140
と記憶自体を待ってつけた

373
00:23:46,140 --> 00:23:46,680
愛の好み

374
00:23:46,680 --> 00:23:49,140
I'm not letting anything tear the Black Bulls apart

375
00:23:49,140 --> 00:23:53,080
色々押さない

376
00:23:53,080 --> 00:23:55,240
高級なシフayette

